{"ts":"2026-08-01T23:05:01.566Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"7d49453d0d45fcc94817af12","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-01T23:05:01.566Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-01T23:05:01.566Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Delivery evidence: added the opt-in --token-accounting contract across CLI, structured errors, MCP tool calls, and public SDK exports. Receipts count exact UTF-8 bytes before the receipt, use ceil(bytes/4), attribute result_rows/envelope/diagnostics/hints exactly to the total, measure their own bounded overhead, and exclude only token_accounting. Disabled-path corpus assertions prove no receipt or output-byte cost when off; independent rerender assertions prove reported totals cannot drift. The final sandboxed suite passed 6,688 tests with 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines. Contract snapshots, typecheck, static quality, duplicate detection, secrets scan, docs links, and context-eval gates passed. Packed npm and Bun consumers resolved their executable inside unrelated install roots; success and not-found output both carried accounting, and direct @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk imports returned receipts."}]}],"before_hash":"cc4babae4dd50054359b6d1a1c3209f90a59ca8f8b64e7d6ba5c78287a2c2360","after_hash":"c1e3414928087956cb28d73f43fbad1b98b917ec81e3fd7a6d7815258b09ba9b"}
